e (`\u2705\ud83e\udd16`). | Visualizes pending agent hold, countdown progress bar, and veto snap-back toast.<br>[images/16-async-agent-gate-states.png](images/16-async-agent-gate-states.png) |\n\n---\n\n### Group E: Administrative Hardening, RBAC & Gate Rework Verification (Spec S3, S4, S11, S14)\n\n| Task ID | Spec Ref | User Persona | Task Title | Step-by-Step Human / Browser Verification Actions | Expected Outcome & Screenshot Target |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **`UT-17`** | **S2.2, S4.4, S15.1** | Server Admin (AAL2) | **Admin Browser QA: Auth Studio, Principals & Favicon** | 1. Navigate to `/admin/auth`.<br>2. Inspect multi-card authentication ordering and lockout protection.<br>3. Inspect Principal Management kind filter tabs (`ALL`, `USER`, `GROUP`, `AGENT`).<br>4. Click `+ Create Principal`, select `GROUP` or `AGENT`, provide identifier and display name, and submit.<br>5. Verify `GET /favicon.ico` returns HTTP 200 with `Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400`. | Auth Studio manages USER/GROUP/AGENT principals; `/favicon.ico` serves branded asset cleanly.<br>[images/17-admin-browser-qa.png](images/17-admin-browser-qa.png) |\n| **`UT-18`** | **S3.1-S3.4, S13.2, S15.2** | Standard Member | **Standard User Browser QA & Negative RBAC Isolation** | 1. Authenticate as standard workspace member (`WORKSPACE_MEMBER`).<br>2. Browse assigned projects, board, list, docs, and ticket drawer.<br>3. Attempt navigation to administrative routes (`/admin/auth`, `/admin/standalone`, `/admin/mcp`, `/projects/KAN/settings/custom-fields`).<br>4. Verify custom fields editor fails closed with access denied toast/banner.<br>5. Confirm zero administrative controls or privileged mutation buttons leak into client DOM. | Negative RBAC strictly isolates standard users; privileged views fail closed without privilege leaks.<br>[images/18-standard-user-negative-rbac.png](images/18-standard-user-negative-rbac.png) |\n| **`UT-19`** | **S11.1-S11.4, S14.3** | Security Architect / Agent | **CLI MCP Scoping Matrix & E2E Gate Rework Loop** | 1. Audit all 12 `/mcp/admin` tools in `mcp/auth.py` for action-aware scope enforcement (`admin:read`, `admin:write`, `admin:destructive`).<br>2. Verify `project` argument alias to `project_key` on `manage_ai_and_agent_runners` and `architect_project`.<br>3. Verify OpenAI Codex CLI invocation enforces `codex exec -s read-only -` and rejects `-p`.<br>4. Run E2E transition gate rework loop: first transition enters `pending_agent` (`\u23f3\ud83e\udd16`), verifier rejects initial commit SHA with `cited_files`, rolls back to source state (`\ud83d\uded1\ud83e\udd16`), developer commits rework fix, and second transition evaluates fixed commit SHA, records `verdict=\"APPROVE\"` (`\u2705\ud83e\udd16`), advancing state and appending immutable hash-chained audit record. | Full 12-tool scope matrix enforced; E2E gate rework loop executes and logs immutable provenance.<br>[images/19-mcp-scoping-and-rework-loop.png](images/19-mcp-scoping-and-rework-loop.png) |\n\n![Workflow Transition Studio and Dry-Run Drawer](images/15-workflow-transition-studio.png)\n\n![Async Agent Gate Card States and Snap-Back Lifecycle](images/16-async-agent-gate-states.png)\n"
+    "content": "# [Architectural] \ud83d\udc4dkanban User Task & Architecture QA Verification Matrix\n\n> **Purpose:** This document maps every functional domain in [System Topology and Multi-Container Architecture](System-Topology-and-Multi-Container-Architecture) (Sections 1-15) to concrete human user tasks, live `/browser` verification scenarios, screenshot deliverables, and API/MCP schema audits.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Subagent Task Assignment Roster\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    Spec[\"Authoritative Product Spec (S1-S15)\"] --> QAPipeline[\"Forensic QA Verification Pipeline\"]\n    \n    subgraph Execution[\"Parallel Verification Engines\"]\n        Bot1[\"Browser QA Bot 1<br/>Board, Views, 17-Feature Ticket Screen\"]\n        Bot2[\"Browser QA Bot 2<br/>Docs, Stickies, Markdown, Sparkle (\u2728)\"]\n        Bot3[\"Browser QA Bot 3<br/>Auth, Security, MCP & Workflow Studios\"]\n        MCPAudit[\"MCP Evaluator Bot<br/>27 Live Tool Schemas & Budgets\"]\n    end\n    \n    QAPipeline --> Bot1\n    QAPipeline --> Bot2\n    QAPipeline --> Bot3\n    QAPipeline --> MCPAudit\n    \n    Bot1 --> Artifacts[\"Visual Proof Packet (35+ Screenshots in images/)\"]\n    Bot2 --> Artifacts\n    Bot3 --> Artifacts\n    MCPAudit --> Artifacts\n    \n    Artifacts --> RealityChecker[\"reality-checker Forensic Audit Gate<br/>(Grade-A READY Certification)\"]\n```\n\n| Subagent Role | Model Tier | Assigned Architecture Sections | Primary Deliverables |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- | :--- |\n| **Browser QA & Screenshot Bot 1: Core Board, Views & Ticket Drawer** | `flash` | **S6** (Board, Whitespace, `<EmojiHint>`), **S7** (17-Feature Ticket Screen, `?peek=` Drawer, Rail, 4-Tab Activity) | Live `/browser` human walkthrough of Workspace Home, Board, List (3-pane split), Table, Calendar, Timeline, Quick-Create (`C`), and Ticket Drawer (`?peek=`). Captures annotated screenshots into `thumbs-up-kanban.wiki/images/`. |\n| **Browser QA & Screenshot Bot 2: Docs, Stickies, Editor & Sparkle (`\u2728`)** | `flash` | **S5** (Canonical Markdown, Mermaid, SVG), **S8** (Hierarchical Docs & Stickies Promotion), **S9** (Sparkle FIM Completion & Right-Click Accept) | Live `/browser` human walkthrough of Workspace/Project Stickies, Sticky-to-Doc AI Promotion modal, Docs ltree tree & outline, Editor Markdown/Mermaid rendering, and Sparkle (`\u2728`) ghost-text completion. Captures screenshots into `thumbs-up-kanban.wiki/images/`. |\n| **Browser QA & Screenshot Bot 3: Auth, Security, MCP & Workflow Studios** | `flash` | **S2** (Standalone Status Panel), **S4** (Multi-Card Auth Studio & `/setup`), **S11** (MCP Access & Scopable Keys Studio), **S13** (Custom Fields Studio), **S14** (Workflow Transition Studio & Dry-Run Drawer) | Live `/browser` human walkthrough of `/setup`, `/login`, `/admin/auth`, `/admin/mcp`, `/projects/KAN/settings/workflows`, `/projects/KAN/settings/custom-fields`, and `/admin/standalone`. Captures screenshots into `thumbs-up-kanban.wiki/images/`. |\n| **MCP Tools JSON vs. Expectation Evaluator Bot** | `flash` | **S11** (3-Surface MCP Server: `/mcp/agent`, `/mcp/docs`, `/mcp/admin`), **S3.5** (Read-Taint Guard), **S14** (Admin Tool 8 & 9) | Audits all 27 live MCP tool JSON schemas (`/tmp/mcp_tools_actual.json`) against Spec S11 expectations for parameter clarity, `EntityResolver` human keys, `lod` tiers, 2-stage destructive confirmations, and LLM ergonomics. Produces `thumbs-up-kanban.wiki/MCP-Tools-Usability-Audit.md`. |\n| **Wiki Documentation Architect & Author** | `flash` / Coordinator | **S1-S15** (Full System Coverage + OpenAPI 184-Route Reference + MCP 27-Tool Reference) | Authors complete 10-page Wiki in `thumbs-up-kanban.wiki/` with `_Sidebar.md`, `_Footer.md`, embedded screenshots, Mermaid diagrams, REST OpenAPI reference, MCP catalog, and CLI runbooks. |\n| **Carbon Architecture-vs-Docs Delta Auditor** | `pro` (Carbon) | **S1-S15** Cross-Layer Forensic Delta Audit | Compares `docs/ARCHITECTURE_AND_PRODUCT_SPEC.md` and actual codebase against all Wiki topics, browser QA findings, and API/MCP schemas to identify missing features, incomplete items, and actionable backlog tickets. |\n\n---\n\n## 2. User Task Catalogue by Architecture Specification Section\n\n### Group A: Onboarding, Authentication & Standalone Operations (Spec S2, S3, S4)\n\n| Task ID | Spec Ref | User Persona | Task Title | Step-by-Step Human / Browser Verification Actions | Expected Outcome & Screenshot Target |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **`UT-01`** | **S2.2, S4.2** | Platform Operator | **First-Boot `/setup` Claim Wizard** | 1. Navigate to `/setup` on a fresh instance.<br>2. Inspect the single-use `kb_setup_*` bootstrap token input, initial admin username/password fields, and workspace creation form.<br>3. Verify pre-session CSRF bootstrap (`__Host-kb_csrf` / `kb_csrf`). | Renders clean First-Boot Claim Wizard without 403 CSRF errors.<br>[images/01-first-boot-setup.png](images/01-first-boot-setup.png) |\n| **`UT-02`** | **S4.1, S4.3** | End User / Admin | **Multi-Card Login & Passkey/TOTP Prompt** | 1. Navigate to `/login`.<br>2. Verify ordered authentication cards (Local Admin, OIDC/OAuth2, LDAPS, WebAuthn Passkey `rp.name = \"\ud83d\udc4dkanban\"`).<br>3. Test credential entry and session establishment. | Displays enabled auth cards in `sort_rank` order with zero implicit email auto-merge.<br>[images/02-multi-card-login.png](images/02-multi-card-login.png) |\n| **`UT-03`** | **S4.4** | Server Admin (AAL2) | **Admin Auth Studio Management** | 1. Navigate to `/admin/auth`.<br>2. Inspect auth card list, enable/disable toggles, drag reorder, write-only secret fields, `Test Handshake` action, and `LOCKOUT_PREVENTED` break-glass guard. | Shows Auth Studio with mandatory vs. optional config sections and lockout guard.<br>[images/03-admin-auth-studio.png](images/03-admin-auth-studio.png) |\n| **`UT-04`** | **S2.2, S2.4** | Platform Operator | **Standalone Status Panel & Compose Export** | 1. Navigate to `/admin/standalone`.<br>2. Check volume persistence probe status (`/var/lib/kanban/data`), dismissible notification pill, encrypted backup trigger, and `docker-compose.yml` 5-network export tab. | Displays green/amber persistence status and copyable 5-network production Compose bundle.<br>[images/04-standalone-status-panel.png](images/04-standalone-status-panel.png) |\n\n![First-Boot Setup Wizard](images/01-first-boot-setup.png)\n\n![Multi-Card Login Screen](images/02-multi-card-login.png)\n\n---\n\n### Group B: Workspace Home, Multi-Layout Views & 17-Feature Ticket Screen (Spec S6, S7)\n\n| Task ID | Spec Ref | User Persona | Task Title | Step-by-Step Human / Browser Verification Actions | Expected Outcome & Screenshot Target |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **`UT-05`** | **S6.1, S6.3** | Project Lead | **Workspace Home & Project Creation** | 1. Navigate to `/`.<br>2. Inspect project cards (`KAN`), quick-links (`Work Items`, `Board`, `Stickies`, `Docs`, `Custom Fields`), and click `+ Create Project` modal. | Renders Workspace Home grid and project creation modal.<br>[images/05-workspace-home.png](images/05-workspace-home.png) |\n| **`UT-06`** | **S6.2, S6.4** | Developer | **Kanban Board View & Optimistic Drag (`<12ms`)** | 1. Navigate to `/projects/KAN/issues?layout=board`.<br>2. Verify breathable whitespace, state columns (`Backlog`, `Todo`, `In Progress`, `Done`), corporate priority badges, `<EmojiHint>` hover tooltips, and card drag-and-drop. | Columns render with virtualized cards, semantic emojis, and instant drag response.<br>[images/06-board-view.png](images/06-board-view.png) |\n| **`UT-07`** | **S6.3** | Developer / PM | **Multi-Layout Switching: List, Table, Calendar & Timeline (Gantt)** | 1. Switch layouts via `?layout=list` (3-pane split view), `?layout=table`, `?layout=calendar`, and `?layout=timeline`.<br>2. Inspect filters bar, 2D swimlane grouping, and Gantt dependency arrows (`BLOCKS`). | All 5 layouts render cleanly without full-page reloads.<br